## 4개 모듈 상세

### Module 1: byzantine_fault_tolerance.fl (600줄)

```
ByzantineNode {
    node_id: u64
    is_byzantine: bool
    trust_score: f64
    vote_history: Vec<Vote>
}

ByzantineFaultDetector {
    fn detect_byzantine_node() -> bool
    fn isolate_faulty_node() -> Result
    fn recover_consensus() -> ConsensusResult
    fn calculate_trust_score() -> f64
}

구현:
- PBFT (Practical Byzantine Fault Tolerance) 3단계
- Pre-prepare → Prepare → Commit 프로토콜
- Trust scoring (악의 노드 감지)
- f < n/3 수학적 보장
```

### Module 2: advanced_consensus.fl (500줄)

```
AdvancedRaftNode {
    term: u64
    log: Vec<LogEntry>
    commit_index: u64
    snapshot: Option<Snapshot>
}

구현:
- Log compaction (Snapshot)
- Leader lease (성능 최적화)
- Read-only optimization
- Pipeline log replication
```

### Module 3: production_hardening.fl (450줄)

```
ProductionConfig {
    max_memory_mb: u64
    latency_sla_ms: u32
    retry_policy: RetryPolicy
    circuit_breaker: CircuitBreakerConfig
}

구현:
- Circuit breaker 패턴
- Retry with exponential backoff
- Rate limiting
- Health check endpoint
```

### Module 4: phase7_integration.fl (400줄)

```
Phase7System {
    byzantine_detector: ByzantineFaultDetector
    consensus: AdvancedRaftNode
    production: ProductionHardening
    metrics: Phase7Metrics
}

fn validate_all_rules() -> Phase7Validation
fn get_system_health() -> HealthStatus
fn simulate_byzantine_attack(count: u32) -> AttackResult
```

